    "rich_text_intro": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_intro": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The classic, humble French salad, made with Seatopia Steelhead in place of canned tuna. The fish is wrapped in foil with olive oil and lemon and steamed on the grill, so it comes out moist and flakes into big, tender pieces over the platter.</p><p>Everything else is simple produce at its best &mdash; baby potatoes, string beans, tomatoes, olives, jammy eggs and crisp greens &mdash; pulled together with a bright Dijon lemon vinaigrette. It is a salad made to be shared, and it is just as good warm as at room temperature.</p>",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_font": "body",
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        }
