            "custom_icon": "",
            "heading": "About 40 minutes",
            "text": "<p>The potatoes, beans and eggs share one pot, and the steelhead cooks in its foil packet at the same time. Most of the work is chopping while things boil.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
