            "heading": "Steamed in foil",
            "text": "<p>Parchment inside foil, olive oil, salt and sliced lemon, sealed tight. 10 minutes on the grill or 15 in a 350&deg;F oven, then let it cool a little before it goes on the salad.</p>",
