          }
        },
        "m_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Almost everything here can be done before anyone sits down. Boil the potatoes, beans and eggs and cook the steelhead ahead, then let them come to room temperature &mdash; a ni&ccedil;oise is meant to be eaten that way. The vinaigrette is made in a small jar, so give it a hard shake right before it goes on. Dress the platter at the last minute so the greens stay crisp.</p>",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_font": "body",
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
