          }
        },
        "f_head": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why steelhead takes the tuna&rsquo;s place",
            "heading_size": "title-md",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "f_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>A traditional ni&ccedil;oise leans on canned tuna. Steelhead brings a soft, rich flake and a mild flavour that sits comfortably beside the briny olives and the sharp vinaigrette, and steamed in a sealed packet it stays moist enough to lay over the platter in large pieces.</p><p>Our Steelhead is sourced from best-in-class aquaculture. Blast-frozen to -10&deg;F at harvest, vacuum sealed. Every supplier is third-party tested for nutrition, mercury and microplastics, then randomly audited to ensure consistent compliance with the Seatopia Standard. Low mercury, tested to a tenth of the FDA action level. We test and publish omega-3, protein, selenium, vitamin D and B12.</p>",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_font": "body",
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "f_btn": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
            "button_label": "How we source it",
            "button_link": "/pages/why-clean-seafood-matters",
            "button_style": "secondary",
            "button_size": "md",
            "button_external": false,
            "button_icon": true
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "f_sub",
